---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="text-amber-400 tracking-[0.3em] text-sm uppercase">About</span>
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-light mt-4">The Photographer</h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Profile Image -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <img 
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=800&q=80" 
          alt="Michael - Photographer" 
          class="w-48 h-48 mx-auto rounded-full object-cover border-4 border-neutral-800"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert mx-auto">
        <p class="text-xl text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed text-center mb-8">
          With over a decade of experience behind the lens, I specialize in capturing 
          the raw emotion of the human spirit and the mesmerizing beauty of the underwater world.
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mt-16">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 tracking-wider text-sm uppercase mb-4">Portrait Photography</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
              My portrait work is driven by a passion for uncovering the unique stories 
              hidden within each face. I believe every person has a narrative worth telling, 
              and my goal is to capture those authentic moments of connection, vulnerability, 
              and strength that define who we are.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="text-cyan-400 tracking-wider text-sm uppercase mb-4">Underwater Photography</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
              The ocean has always called to me. There's something otherworldly about 
              floating in a realm where light behaves differently, where colors shift 
              and dance, and where marine life moves with grace that defies description. 
              Through my underwater work, I aim to bring these magical moments to the surface.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-neutral-800">
          <h3 class="text-center text-2xl font-light mb-8">Equipment</h3>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
            <div>
              <p class="text-amber-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Camera</p>
              <p class="text-neutral-300">Sony A7R V</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-amber-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Underwater Housing</p>
              <p class="text-neutral-300">Nauticam NA-A7R5</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-amber-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Lenses</p>
              <p class="text-neutral-300">85mm f/1.4, 24-70mm f/2.8</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 text-center">
          <p class="text-neutral-500 mb-6">Let's work together</p>
          <a 
            href="/contact" 
            class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-amber-500 text-neutral-950 tracking-wider text-sm hover:bg-amber-400 transition-colors"
          >
            Get in Touch
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
